      {
        "thread_id": "TH5",
        "thread_goal": "Review post-implementation performance and close the project.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M76",
            "speaker_id": 33287,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Team, time for our final project update. I've compiled the Post-Implementation Performance Tracking Sheet A6 and compared it to our original baseline in A1. The results are very positive: we've achieved a 15% reduction in downtime and an 18% drop in food waste. The full summary for T10 is attached.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A1",
              "A6",
              "T10"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "chart_with_upwards_trend",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M77",
            "speaker_id": 95118,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "This is fantastic news! The new SOPs and checklists are making a real difference. I've had positive feedback from all three shifts, they feel the line is running much more smoothly. The communication plan for T12 worked well to keep everyone informed. Great work, everyone!",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "🎉",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M78",
            "speaker_id": 11000,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "Wow, a 20% drop in waste! We totally smashed it! I knew focusing on Line 3 was the right call!",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M79",
            "speaker_id": 386277,
            "reply_to": "M76",
            "text": "Those are solid, measurable improvements. The new PMs seem to have stabilized the belt tension and sensor issues. It's good to see the data back that up.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M80",
            "speaker_id": 33287,
            "reply_to": "M78",
            "text": "To be precise, it was an 18% drop in food waste on the main line, but still an excellent result. Thanks for everyone's hard work. The final question for us as a team is what to do next. Given this success, should we recommend extending these new practices to other packaging lines? D8",
            "mentions": [
              11000
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M81",
            "speaker_id": 95118,
            "reply_to": "M80",
            "text": "Absolutely! Line 2 has similar equipment and could definitely benefit from the same standardized SOPs and PM schedule. I'd fully support proposing a rollout there.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M82",
            "speaker_id": 386277,
            "reply_to": "M80",
            "text": "I agree. We have a proven model now. We should recommend a phased rollout, starting with Line 2 next quarter.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M83",
            "speaker_id": 11000,
            "reply_to": "M80",
            "text": "Yes, let's do all the lines! We can do them all at once.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M84",
            "speaker_id": 33287,
            "reply_to": "M83",
            "text": "A phased approach starting with one more line is probably more manageable. Let's stick with the recommendation for Line 2 first. So, we are agreed on the decision D8: we will formally recommend extending the practices to other lines, starting with Line 2.",
            "mentions": [
              11000
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "heavy_check_mark",
                "count": 2
              }
